@startuml RuntimeViewFullTest
title Runtime-view full test

actor "User" as user
note as UserNote
  The user calls https://openims.test.local:443 or http://openims.test.local:8080
end note
user .. UserNote

[OpenIMS (:443 and :8080)] as OpenIMS
note as OpenIMSNote
    Started via "task BaseExampleStart" (or shorter: "task beu").
    The domain can be changed using the commandline-parameter "--InitialDomain <domain>".
    Backend and frontend are running in the container.
end note 
OpenIMS .. OpenIMSNote

[Database (:5432)] as OpenIMSDatabase
note as OpenIMSDatabaseNote
    Database-container
end note 
OpenIMSDatabase .. OpenIMSDatabaseNote

user --> OpenIMS
OpenIMS --> OpenIMSDatabase
@enduml
